Two ideas for trophies that I haven't yet seen in the June or November
Nethack tournies:

1. "Dungeon-level-adjusted lowest-ascending score" -- since the
Nethack log file clearly spits out the lowest dungeon level reached,
it should be a simple calculation to remove this part from an
ascension's score, making this trophy more about skill than the luck
that it currently is.

2. Sorear and I were talking about this one -- a "annoying tourist
award" trophy, which counts the number of different monster types that
were "blinded by the flash" with your camera. Whoever photographs (and
blinds) the greatest number of unique monsters would get the award. If
we didn't want to patch the source, we could do a .ttyrec parser that
looked for these messages and calculated the tally.

Just kicking around some ideas. :)

